---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Frequently Asked Questions | MWRS"
  description="Answers to common questions about counseling, medication management, insurance, telehealth, and getting started with care at Mental Wellness & Relationship Services (MWRS)."
>
  <main class="faq-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="faq-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p>
          Here are a few common questions about counseling, medication
          management, and getting started at Mental Wellness &amp;
          Relationship Services (MWRS). If you don't see your question
          here, you're always welcome to reach out directly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ list -->
    <section class="faq-list-section">
      <div class="section-inner">

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            How do I get started with counseling or medication care?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              The simplest way is to fill out our
              <a href="/contact-us">Start Counseling or Medication Care</a>
              form. Our intake team will review your information, check
              availability, and contact you to discuss next steps and scheduling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            What insurance plans do you accept?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We work with a wide range of insurance providers. Below is our current list:</p>
            <div class="insurance-grid">
              <ul>
                <li>Cash Pay</li>
                <li>Aetna</li>
                <li>Blue Cross of Idaho</li>
                <li>BPA EAP</li>
                <li>Champ VA</li>
                <li>Cigna/Evernorth</li>
                <li>Curalinc EAP</li>
                <li>First Choice</li>
                <li>GPA</li>
                <li>Humana</li>
                <li>Kaiser</li>
                <li>Magellan</li>
              </ul>
              <ul>
                <li>Medicaid (Idaho)</li>
                <li>Medicare</li>
                <li>Molina of Idaho</li>
                <li>New Directions EAP</li>
                <li>Optum</li>
                <li>Pacific Source</li>
                <li>Premera Blue Cross</li>
                <li>Regence BCBS (Any State)</li>
                <li>TriCare West</li>
                <li>TriWest / VA</li>
                <li>United Healthcare (UHC)</li>
                <li>Vital EAP</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            Which locations offer in-person appointments?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              We currently offer in-person counseling in Coeur d'Alene,
              Ponderay, Priest River, and Oldtown. Medication management is
              available in Coeur d'Alene, Ponderay, and via telehealth.
            </p>
            <p>
              You can see a full overview of our offices on the
              <a href="/locations">Locations</a> page.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            Can I see the same provider for both counseling and medication?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              In most cases, counseling and medication management are provided
              by different clinicians on the same team. Your counselor and nurse
              practitioner can coordinate care as appropriate so that your
              treatment plan feels cohesive and focused on your goals.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            Do you work with teens and children?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              Yes. Several of our counselors work with teens, and some providers
              see children depending on age and clinical fit. When you complete
              the intake form, let us know your child's age and what you're
              hoping to work on so we can match you with an appropriate clinician.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            What if I'm not sure whether I need counseling, medication, or both?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              That's very common. On our
              <a href="/contact-us">Start Counseling or Medication Care</a>
              form you can select "I'm not sure / both." Our team will review
              your responses and may recommend starting with counseling, a
              medication consultation, or a combination depending on your
              symptoms and preferences.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you want to learn more about what medication support looks
              like, you can also visit our
              <a href="/psychiatry">Medication Management page</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            What should I expect in my first appointment?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              The first visit is mostly about getting to know you. Your provider
              will ask about your concerns, history, and what you hope to change.
              You are always welcome to move at your own pace, and you do not
              have to share anything you're not ready to talk about yet. If
              you're seeking medication care specifically, you can also visit our
              <a href="/psychiatry">Medication Management page</a> to learn more
              about the process.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            What if I have questions about a bill?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              If something on your statement doesn't look right, or you want
              help understanding a charge, our admin team is happy to review it
              with you. You can send a quick billing message through our secure
              online form.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="/billing" class="faq-link">Go to Billing & Payments →</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">
            Do you offer a Sliding Fee Discount Program?
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>
              Yes. MWRS offers a Sliding Fee Discount Program for clients who
              qualify based on household size and income. If you'd like details
              or want to request an application, you can use the brief form on
              our <a href="/services#sliding-fee">Services page</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              The form only asks for basic contact information and lets our team
              follow up with the exact steps and documentation you may need.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="faq-cta">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
        <p>
          You're welcome to reach out directly. Our team is glad to help you
          figure out the right starting point — whether that's counseling,
          medication care, or something in between.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Start counseling or medication care
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .faq-page {
      background-color: #e5e9f3;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
    }

    /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-hero {
      padding: 10rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .faq-hero h1 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .faq-hero p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Shared section wrapper ───────────────────────── */
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── FAQ list ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-list-section {
      padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    }

    .faq-list-section .section-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.3rem;
    }

    /* ── FAQ items ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-item {
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(155, 142, 196, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
    }

    .faq-item summary {
      list-style: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    .faq-question {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #111827;
      margin: 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .faq-item summary::after {
      content: "+";
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #9b8ec4;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }

    .faq-item[open] summary::after {
      content: "–";
      color: #7d6fb3;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .faq-answer a,
    .faq-link {
      color: #7d6fb3;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .faq-cta h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .faq-cta p {
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Outline button ───────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
        box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling {
      border-color: #7d6fb3;
      color: #7d6fb3;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling:hover {
      background: #7d6fb3;
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(125, 111, 179, 0.3);
    }

    /* ── Insurance grid ───────────────────────────────── */
    .insurance-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .insurance-grid ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      color: #4b5563;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>